(3) THE OCTONION OBJECT C3[C3] (n=9)
============================================================
  C3[C3]: N=9, regular=True (out-deg 4); charS=(1, 0, 36, 0, 270, 0, 756, 0, 729, 0)
  SC4(C3[C3]) = 81; H(C3[C3]) = 3159
  lambda^2 multiset = [np.float64(0.0), np.float64(3.0), np.float64(3.0), np.float64(3.0), np.float64(3.0), np.float64(3.0), np.float64(3.0), np.float64(27.0), np.float64(27.0)];  var(lambda^2) = 104.0
  (transitive n=9 var = 2*C(9,3) = 168; this measures its GIT-instability)

